---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & Cross-Border Data Governance | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Official GDPR, EU Data Act, and China PIPL statutory privacy policy, data boundary architecture, and zero-knowledge cryptographic vault governance."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Statutory Regulatory Compliance</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Privacy Policy & <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">Cross-Border Data Governance</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Effective Date: November 2026 · Compliant with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR), the EU Data Act (Regulation EU 2023/2854), and China's Personal Information Protection Law (PIPL) and Data Security Law (DSL).
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1</span>
          <span>Data Boundary & Sovereign Cleanroom Architecture</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          EU DPP Provider operates under strict data minimization and cross-border security principles. In accordance with Article 77 of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 and domestic cross-border security regulations:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>Domestic Cleanroom Computation:</strong> Primary manufacturing telemetry, enterprise bill of materials (BOM), and cost records are processed entirely within domestic cloud nodes.</li>
          <li><strong>Strict Whitelist Export Engine:</strong> Only mandatory statutory disclosure fields (Annex XIII categories) cross borders. New or unmapped proprietary fields are blocked by default.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero-Knowledge Cryptographic Shield:</strong> Proprietary chemical ratios and supplier commercial contracts are verified via cryptographic proofs (ZKP) without transmitting raw underlying values.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">2</span>
          <span>Data Ownership & 10-Year Lifecycle Retention</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          All customer battery data uploaded or synchronized with EU DPP Provider remains the sole property of the client. EU DPP Provider acts strictly as a certified Data Processor under GDPR Article 28:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>10-Year Hosting Guarantee:</strong> Data carriers (GS1 Digital Link URIs) and public/authority disclosure tiers remain active for 10 years following placement on the EU market, matching statutory battery lifespan.</li>
          <li><strong>Full Exportability:</strong> Clients may export complete historical data sets, cryptographic audit logs, and eIDAS signatures at any time in standardized JSON-LD / XML formats.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">3</span>
          <span>Data Protection Officer & Contact</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          For inquiries regarding privacy, data protection impact assessments (DPIA), or cross-border data transfer agreements (SCCs), contact our Data Protection Officer:
        </p>
        <div class="neo-well p-4 flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Data Protection Office (DPO)</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">EU DPP Provider · Frankfurt Operations Center</div>
          </div>
          <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 hover:text-cyan-800 font-mono">
            info@eudppprovider.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
